  "releaseNotes": "Cross-platform LIFX API with Cloud and LAN support\n\t\t\t- Full Cloud HTTP API coverage (Lights, Effects, Scenes, Colors)\n\t\t\t- LAN protocol for local network control\n\t\t\t- Type-safe Refit-based API\n\t\t\t- Comprehensive test coverage (232+ tests)\n\t\t\t- Models are POCOs (no dependencies)\n\t\t\t- Full async/await throughout\n\t\t\t- .NET 10 support",
